  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Leaching: It involves the treatment of the&nbsp;ore with a suitable reagent as to make it soluble&nbsp;while impurity remains insoluble and after this, the ore is recovered from the solution by suitable methods.</p><p>The principal ore of aluminium and&nbsp;bauxite&nbsp;usually contain&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SiO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, iron oxides and titanium oxides as impurities.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>NaOH</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Na</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Al</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>Na</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Al</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">&#183;</mo><msub><mi>xH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>NaHCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>The sodium silicate remains in the solution and hydrated alumina is filtered, dried and heated to give pure&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">&#183;</mo><msub><mi>xH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mn>1470</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>xH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
